During the [[The galaxy|galaxy-wide]] conflict known as the [[Clone Wars]], the [[Onderon rebels]] built and maintained '''the nest''', a [[Tree|wooden]] fort built on a [[mountain]] that they used in their fight against the illegitimate [[King]] of [[Onderon]] [[Sanjay Rash]], who had dethroned the [[planet]]'s rightful king, [[Ramsis Dendup]], and subsequently allied Onderon with the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist Alliance]].<ref name="Tipping Points" />

